We are pleased to announce SELinux Userspace release 20160223. Tarballs
are available on the Releases wiki page [1]. For git users, it has been
tagged as 2016. This release includes numerous bug fixes and new
features. Please see the change logs for a detailed list of
updates.

Thanks to all those that have submitted patches!

